{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. If visible, approach and grab. If not visible, scan area. Then move and process object if grabbed.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
